msgstr "Exchange complete campaigns, including schedules, products, campaign prices and order. Legacy calendar-only files remain compatible."

msgid "JSON es el formato principal. CSV incluye filas <code>campaign</code> y <code>product</code> para editarlas en una hoja de cálculo."
msgstr "JSON is the primary format. CSV includes <code>campaign</code> and <code>product</code> rows that can be edited in a spreadsheet."

